5
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:23.472
Third, developers stay on ordinary Git while checking against one hundred thousand items takes seventy microseconds.

6
00:00:24.032 --> 00:00:30.423
Traditional version control was built around files, folder paths, and line numbers. Rename a helper function,

