Imagine a kitchen library where fixing one recipe forced you to lock the entire cookbook shelf.

10
00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:56.297
By splitting Rust and Python source files into top-level structural items while preserving exact original bytes

11
00:00:56.297 --> 00:01:03.543
